<title>USA: Wells Fargo, Safeway in branch pact.</title>
<headline>Wells Fargo, Safeway in branch pact.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wells Fargo and Co and Safeway Inc said they are opening 36 new in-store branches this year in California.</p>
<p>Wells Fargo has opened 76 branches inside Safeway stores in California since 1990.</p>
<p>The first 25 in-store branches will open by the end of August. The others are expected to open in the fourth quarter, with more locations planned for 1998.  The new branches will be fully staffed with bank officers who can provide personal, on-the-spot service, which will be augmented by user-friendly, state-of-the-art technology.</p>
</text>
